%% SequenceViews::pubSubView — sequence rendering (view def SequenceView)
sequenceDiagram
  participant n0 as «part»<br>producer
  link n0: Source @ https://example.test/src/sequence.sysml#L26
  participant n1 as «part»<br>server
  link n1: Source @ https://example.test/src/sequence.sysml#L32
  participant n2 as «part»<br>consumer
  link n2: Source @ https://example.test/src/sequence.sysml#L41
  n2->>n1: subscribe_message
  n0->>n1: publish_message
  n1->>n2: deliver_message
